#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUseLegacyGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUseLegacyGravity [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUseLegacyGravity [BoolProperty DisplayName meta-data]
