#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUseLegacyGravity
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUseLegacyGravity [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUseLegacyGravity [BoolProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUseLegacyGravity"
msgid "Gravityの適用方式（レガシー互換）\ntrue : 従来互換（位置に 0.5 * Gravity * dt^2 を加算）\nfalse: AnimDynamics互換（速度に Gravity * dt を加算してから位置更新）\nGravity application method (legacy compatibility)\ntrue : Legacy compatibility (add 0.5 * Gravity * dt^2 to position)\nfalse: AnimDynamics compatibility (add Gravity * dt to velocity before updating position)"
msgstr "Gravityの適用方式（レガシー互換）\ntrue : 従来互換（位置に 0.5 * Gravity * dt^2 を加算）\nfalse: AnimDynamics互換（速度に Gravity * dt を加算してから位置更新）"

