msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind"
msgid "パラメトリック合成風。UE の WindDirectionalSource に依存しない。\n合成式: Total = (Constant + Sway + Ripple) × StrengthCycle + Random + Gust（Gust は StartProceduralWindGust API から発生）\nParametric synthesized wind. This does not depend on UE WindDirectionalSource.\nComposition: Total = (Constant + Sway + Ripple) x StrengthCycle + Random + Gust (Gust is triggered via the StartProceduralWindGust API)."
msgstr "パラメトリック合成風。UE の WindDirectionalSource に依存しない。\n合成式: Total = (Constant + Sway + Ripple) × StrengthCycle + Random + Gust（Gust は StartProceduralWindGust API から発生）"

