msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:Damping"
msgid "減衰度：揺れの強さを制御。値が小さいほど、加速度を物理挙動に反映\nDamping physical behavior. As the value is smaller, the acceleration is more reflected to the physical behavior"
