#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness"
msgid "Stiffness"
msgstr ""

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness"
msgid "Stiffnessへの倍率。1未満で元の形状への引き戻しが弱まり、揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for Stiffness. Below 1 the pull back to the pre-physics shape weakens and the sway grows."
msgstr "Stiffnessへの倍率。1未満で元の形状への引き戻しが弱まり、揺れが大きくなる"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "World Damping Location"
msgstr ""

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "WorldDampingLocationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingLocation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの移動量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingLocation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingLocation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component movement and increases the sway."
msgstr "WorldDampingLocationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingLocation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの移動量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "World Damping Rotation"
msgstr ""

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "WorldDampingRotationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingRotation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの回転量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingRotation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingRotation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component rotation and increases the sway."
msgstr "WorldDampingRotationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingRotation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの回転量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる"

